From: Josef Schneider <josef81sch@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Jan 2023 15:23:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix acute accent in manpage
Forwarded: https://github.com/tcsh-org/tcsh/issues/102

---
 tcsh.man.in | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/tcsh.man.in
+++ b/tcsh.man.in
@@ -5174,10 +5174,10 @@
 .Bd -literal -offset indent
 > complete find \e
 \&'n/\-name/f/' 'n/\-newer/f/' 'n/\-{,n}cpio/f/' \e
-\&\'n/\-exec/c/' 'n/\-ok/c/' 'n/\-user/u/' \e
+\&'n/\-exec/c/' 'n/\-ok/c/' 'n/\-user/u/' \e
 \&'n/\-group/g/' 'n/\-fstype/(nfs 4.2)/' \e
 \&'n/\-type/(b c d f l p s)/' \e
-\'c/\-/(name newer cpio ncpio exec ok user \e
+\&'c/\-/(name newer cpio ncpio exec ok user \e
 group fstype type atime ctime depth inum \e
 ls mtime nogroup nouser perm print prune \e
 size xdev)/' \e
